window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>He's my first love. My high school sweetheart. And he's leaving tomorrow for a bigger and better life. </b><br> <br> I've loved Ben almost my entire life, and we have one night left before he heads miles away to college on a football scholarship. I'm bound and determined to make sure this day goes perfectly so he remembers me as the girl he loves. But I cant help worrying that Ill end up as the girl he lov<i>ed</i>.</p>"; 
